      "dc:source": "crimes-at-sea-act-2000.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "Subject to section 2, each Act that is specified in Schedule 2 is\namended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in that\nSchedule, and any other item in that Schedule has effect according\nto its terms.",
      "skos:definition": "Subject to section 2, each Act that is specified in Schedule 2 is\namended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in that\nSchedule, and any other item in that Schedule has effect according\nto its terms.",
